        "created_at": "2017-08-14T23:33:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I an email from FedEx with tracking information for a package from GtG.</p><p>I haven't ordered anything from them since 2015, aside from Kickstarter stuff.</p><p><span>It might be Oblivaeon stuff, but there hasn't been any sort of update indicating that anything is being shipped out. &nbsp;Has anyone else seen a shipping tab like this?</span></p><p><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span>Fedex provides the following details about the package:</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions</td>\n<td>12x12x9 in.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Terms</td>\n<td>Shipper</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><div><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td>FedEx SmartPost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight</td>\n<td>9.3 lbs / 4.22 kgs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Packaging</td>\n<td>Package</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:58.577Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
