        "raw": "<p>I an email from FedEx with tracking information for a package from GtG.</p><p>I haven&#39;t ordered anything from them since 2015, aside from Kickstarter stuff.</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">It might be Oblivaeon stuff, but there hasn&#39;t been any sort of update indicating that anything is being shipped out. &nbsp;Has anyone else seen a shipping tab like this?</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Fedex provides the following details about the package:</span></font></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"column left\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); width: 338.484px; max-width: 49%; float: left; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><table class=\"fact_table\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); width: 338px;\"><tbody style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><tr class=\"fact_table_row dark\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text-decoration: inherit;\">Dimensions</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; width: 196px;\">12x12x9 in.</td></tr><tr class=\"fact_table_row light\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text-decoration: inherit;\">Terms</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; width: 196px;\">Shipper</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"right column\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); width: 338.484px; max-width: 49%; float: right; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><table class=\"fact_table\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); width: 338px;\"><tbody style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><tr class=\"fact_table_row dark\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text-decoration: inherit;\">Service</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; width: 196px;\">FedEx SmartPost</td></tr><tr class=\"fact_table_row light\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text-decoration: inherit;\">Weight</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; width: 196px;\">9.3 lbs / 4.22 kgs</td></tr><tr class=\"fact_table_row dark\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text-decoration: inherit;\">Total pieces</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; width: 196px;\">1</td></tr><tr class=\"fact_table_row light\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;\"><td class=\"label\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 3px; font-weight: 700; display: inline-block; text